{"words": [{"text": "۞ أَفَتَطْمَعُونَ", "translation": "Do you hope"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُوا۟", "translation": "they will believe"}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "translation": "[for] you"}, {"text": "وَقَدْ", "translation": "while indeed"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "(there) has been"}, {"text": "فَرِيقٌۭ", "translation": "a party"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "يَسْمَعُونَ", "translation": "(who used to) hear"}, {"text": "كَلَـٰمَ", "translation": "(the) words"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "يُحَرِّفُونَهُۥ", "translation": "they distort it"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "عَقَلُوهُ", "translation": "they understood it"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "while they"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}], "sahih": "Do you covet [the hope, O believers], that they would believe for you while a party of them used to hear the words of Allāh and then distort it [i.e., the Torah] after they had understood it while they were knowing?"}